  "body": "> This is \"obvioulsy\" some configuration problem on your end.\n> \n> I installed `gnome` and `gnome-extra`. Made a new user account. Logged into new account with gnome desktop. Created custom shortcut to launch `nautilus -w`. Ensured it worked as expected. Installed `aur/art-rawconverter`. Custom shortcut still launches nautilus, as expected.\n\nIt's quite appropriate you used quotes for _obviously_ because this is on a fresh vanilla, install. I did no configurations at all. None what so ever. I just installed arch with `archinstall` then I installed literally  nothing else besides `base-devel`. `git` and `yay`, then `art-rawconverter`.\n\n",
